cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "GTV-informed three-dimensional dose-anatomy learning for severe acute oral mucositis in nasopharyngeal carcinoma: development and external validation"
version: 1.2.0
license: "MIT"
type: software
abstract: "Public analysis code for preprocessing, spatial input construction, 3D CNN development, repeated cross-validation, locked external validation, statistical evaluation, calibration and decision-curve analysis, Layer4 Grad-CAM generation, quality control, and manuscript figure generation."
message: "If you use this software, please cite the associated manuscript and this software release."
authors:
  - given-names: Yijian
    family-names: Cao
keywords:
  - nasopharyngeal carcinoma
  - oral mucositis
  - radiotherapy
  - deep learning
  - three-dimensional convolutional neural network
  - dose map
  - gross tumor volume
  - external validation
